    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDC_9ul6AoM",
      "content": "How long so ideally we're looking for a company that can come and pack everything up and move us. So I don't know how long that process takes and depending on how long the process takes that will inform my request for an actual date.",
      "name": "Graham McCall",
      "time": "2026-09-09T17:26:37.323833",
