    },
    {
      "content": "Okay.",
      "name": "Chauny Shivers",
      "time": "2026-09-09T17:26:43.861225",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "5271673269723136"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay. So depending on this specifications of the move square footage. And just exactly if we're doing a full pack versus a partial pack, all of those things are dependent upon, of course the duration of the move. So, generally just to kind of give you an idea, if we're packing up, let's just say, I don't know what 1500 square foot house, generally any move over a one bedroom apartment generally takes two days. And so how we break that up generally for a house is, we do the packing. All of the packing.",
