      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDC_9ul6AoM",
      "content": "Two days, okay.",
      "name": "Graham McCall",
      "time": "2026-09-09T17:27:36.123833",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "On the first day if it's a full pack, then we'll pack up everything. We'll wrap the furniture, all, all the things. And then the next day the same movers will come back load up the truck and then drop everything off, reassemble everything and just kind of get you know, set up as a new place. So generally, it's a two day, a two day. Those mm-hmm.",
      "name": "Chauny Shivers",
      "time": "2026-09-09T17:27:43.861225",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "5271673269723136"
    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDC_9ul6AoM",
