      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDC_9ul6AoM",
      "content": "Yeah. And our house is 3200 square feet, three bedroom. We don't have a ton of stuff but yeah, and then what's the difference between a I think you said a full pack versus a partial pack?",
      "name": "Graham McCall",
      "time": "2026-09-09T17:28:12.723833",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay.",
